  "id": "preference-for-consistency",
  "term": "preference for consistency",
  "definition": "Preference for consistency is a person’s desire to be, and appear, consistent across their words, beliefs, attitudes, and actions. In decision making, it is linked to a tendency to stick with earlier judgments or choices instead of rethinking them when new but similar situations arise.",
